# Security pass tracker (Flux)

Before planning or implementing substantial Flux work:

1. Read **`plans/security/CURRENT.md`** (active phase, checklists, human decision gates).
2. **State the active phase** in your first reply when relevant (currently **deferred** — Passes 1–5 complete).

## Passes 1–5 — complete

Do not re-litigate completed work. Details: `plans/security/pass-1-summary.md`, `plans/security/CURRENT.md`.

- Pass 1 — gateway Bearer, migration ledger, mesh 401 semantics
- Pass 2 — restore-verified backup before destructive ops (`@flux/core/backup-trust`)
- Pass 3 — system-db cutover gating
- Pass 4 — v2 fleet deep JWT probes
