## Execution discipline

- Destructive paths must use **`allowsDestructiveWithoutOverride`**; overrides only with explicit UX (`--skip-backup-check`, etc.).
- After security-related slices: run `pnpm check:architecture`, `pnpm typecheck`, `pnpm test`; update `CURRENT.md` when adding new passes.
- Documentation: see `.cursor/rules/documentation-freshness.mdc` and `docs/README-MAINTENANCE-CONTRACT.md`.

## Interrupt the user when

- Destructive code paths lack backup trust checks.
- Proposing to treat mesh “Online” as full JWT/RLS success (edge reachable only).
